					8, 3, 8</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 26, 6</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 3, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					4, 7</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 46</span></i>
			.</div>
